### GET all books
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books

### GET one book
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/1

### GET by author
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books?author=Joshua%20Bloch


### CREATE

POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Head First Java",
  "author": "Kathy Sierra",
  "year": 2022
}

### UPDATE
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Effective Java 3rd Edition",
  "author": "Joshua Bloch",
  "year": 2018
}

### DELETE
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/books/1


### Lab 6: page exception handler
GET http://localhost:8080/books/999

### Lab 6: API exception handler
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/999
Accept: application/problem+json

### Lab 8: first page (totalElements = 8 after a clean development start)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books?page=0&size=3

### Lab 8: second page, descending year
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books?page=1&size=3&sort=year,desc

### Lab 8: genre filter
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books?genre=SCIENCE&page=0&size=2

### Lab 8: invalid sort property (observed HTTP 500)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books?sort=nosuchfield
